# SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
# SD host controllers, serving the block class: the card in each one's
# slot at /dev/sdM0, sdM1, ... (9front's letter for SD/MMC). PCI's SD
# hosts (class 08.05; QEMU's sdhci-pci) and the SpacemiT K1's SDHCIs,
# whose ADMA2 descriptors hold 32-bit addresses, below 2 GiB on the K1.
driver sdhci
class block
match pci-class 08.05
match dt spacemit,k1-sdhci
dma-bits 31
sd M
